<title>USA: MOSCOM withdraws IPO of Votan unit.</title>
<headline>MOSCOM withdraws IPO of Votan unit.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSFORD, N.Y. 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MOSCOM Corp said on Tuesday that it has withdrawn the proposed initial public offering of its Votan Corp subsidiary.</p>
<p>MOSCOM said the move follows indications from H.J. Meyers &amp; Co Inc, the underwriter of the offering, that the deal could not be successfully completed.</p>
<p>Following the decision to withdraw the offering, MOSCOM said that it will reduce the operations of Votan and consolidate operations into the company's Pittsford, N.Y. facility.</p>
</text>
